{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026zyZ7zBz0lo1795728825.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>馬來西亞有販毒集團，涉嫌利用空軍設施走私毒品，總值折合近3億港元，包括軍官在內至少13人被捕。</p><p></p><p>馬來西亞內政部長賽義夫丁周四通報國會，指警方在1月蒐集情報，發現多年來有犯罪集團，利用沙巴的空軍設施，走私毒品逾20次。警方及皇家空軍憲兵上周採取行動，檢獲近100公斤重的冰毒，13人被捕，其中7人是空軍人員。</p><p></p><p>賽義夫丁又稱，不法分子累計走私重3噸毒品，總值逾1.5億令吉，他強調毒品是國家頭號敵人，當局會繼續打擊毒販。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T22:47:12.374939+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":208,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T18:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T16:17:34.761723+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T22:40:32.797646+00:00","content_hash":"123e2cf3d83cc17750b94851321aac10b9de929c63742a37dfba490643f01061","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T22:47:12.374939+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}